WEBVTT

00:55.133 --> 00:55.867
(This drama is a work of fiction.)

00:55.867 --> 00:56.701
(All characters, organizations,
and events in this drama are fictitious.)

00:56.701 --> 00:57.502
(This drama complied
with production guidelines...)

00:57.502 --> 00:58.270
(for filming child actors and animals.)

01:12.197 --> 01:12.998
Sir, now.

01:12.998 --> 01:14.366
Hold on. Wait.

01:22.607 --> 01:23.675
Hey.

01:24.309 --> 01:25.811
I told you to wait.

01:36.822 --> 01:39.124
Curry smells good.

01:41.159 --> 01:41.993
What?

01:44.329 --> 01:47.165
Good grief. I told you not to do that.

01:49.134 --> 01:50.669
Where did Myo Jin go?

01:50.669 --> 01:51.870
It's about time to eat.

01:54.139 --> 01:55.774
Did she go fishing with Muljjeong again?

01:57.876 --> 02:00.178
It's always that Muljjeong.

02:01.813 --> 02:04.015
I'll go bring them back, so set out
one more set of spoon and chopsticks.

02:04.850 --> 02:06.818
You really shouldn't be like that.

02:09.554 --> 02:11.456
If you care so much about him,

02:11.690 --> 02:14.092
go eat out with him yourself
and just send our kid home.

02:14.493 --> 02:16.728
Stop letting an outsider
hang around the house.

02:16.728 --> 02:19.097
Outsider?

02:19.097 --> 02:20.665
Are you going to keep saying that?

02:20.665 --> 02:22.501
Is Muljjeongi a stranger to us?

02:22.934 --> 02:24.436
Of course, he's a stranger.

02:25.404 --> 02:27.773
He's not even blind
or missing his arms or legs,

02:28.507 --> 02:31.843
but he still can't earn his keep at
that age, so he's a good-for-nothing bum.

02:32.077 --> 02:33.779
He's a bad influence on our girl too.

02:34.246 --> 02:35.514
Have you already forgotten?

02:35.847 --> 02:37.549
When we first moved here,

02:37.549 --> 02:39.618
who stood up
to the whole neighborhood for us?

02:40.419 --> 02:42.354
From teaching us how to raise seedlings...

02:42.354 --> 02:43.722
to introducing us to clients.

02:44.356 --> 02:47.359
Who do you think
we owe our livelihood to now?

02:49.194 --> 02:50.829
Do you really not remember anymore?

02:55.934 --> 02:57.069
I'm going to bring them back.

03:03.942 --> 03:05.844
I'm so grateful I could cry.

03:05.844 --> 03:08.180
Really.

03:10.749 --> 03:12.851
You're really good at catching fish.

03:13.418 --> 03:14.753
Why can't I do it?

03:15.020 --> 03:16.855
I haven't caught a single one yet.

03:19.291 --> 03:20.559
Myo Jin.

03:21.660 --> 03:24.329
Why can't you catch fish?

03:24.930 --> 03:26.631
You said I keep rushing.

03:26.898 --> 03:28.200
That I don't wait patiently.

03:30.769 --> 03:32.904
Right. If you know what the problem is,

03:32.904 --> 03:34.573
then why do you still think
you can't catch them?

03:35.173 --> 03:36.775
Because fishing is hard.

03:37.008 --> 03:38.343
But I can catch other things well.

03:39.778 --> 03:40.612
Really?

03:42.114 --> 03:44.916
Then should we go catch something else?

03:45.751 --> 03:49.087
You said you're good at catching
everything else, so let's see.

03:54.059 --> 03:54.893
Myo Jin.

03:55.727 --> 03:59.197
Whether you're catching fish
or catching a wild boar,

03:59.197 --> 04:01.066
the method is the same.

04:01.767 --> 04:02.667
What is?

04:02.868 --> 04:04.603
The thing you want to catch.

04:05.537 --> 04:06.938
Think like that thing.

04:07.973 --> 04:09.574
When it'll get hungry,

04:10.342 --> 04:11.843
where you should wait,

04:11.843 --> 04:14.413
and what kind of bait to use.

04:16.348 --> 04:17.482
And then?

04:19.718 --> 04:21.420
You set a trap...

04:21.420 --> 04:22.487
and wait.

04:23.188 --> 04:26.191
The bait changes,
but the way you catch it is the same.

04:27.359 --> 04:28.226
Lastly,

04:29.494 --> 04:30.796
there's just one thing
you need to remember.

04:31.630 --> 04:34.266
Don't rush. Take it slow.

04:34.933 --> 04:35.867
That's right.

04:37.402 --> 04:39.204
Myo Jin, Muljjeong.

04:39.504 --> 04:40.939
Come on and eat.

04:41.573 --> 04:43.108
Your mom made curry.

04:43.475 --> 04:44.643
Come on, both of you.

04:45.210 --> 04:46.044
- Curry?
- Curry?

04:46.478 --> 04:47.379
Let's go.

04:53.685 --> 04:56.488
(Hunt)

04:57.589 --> 05:01.126
(NFS)

05:06.732 --> 05:10.068
You're pestering me
this early in the morning.

05:10.068 --> 05:11.136
Where's Detective Woo?

05:11.136 --> 05:12.971
He says he has something else
to take care of.

05:13.805 --> 05:16.007
He calls nonstop when he needs something,

05:16.007 --> 05:17.409
then disappears when it's time to show up.

05:18.343 --> 05:19.277
He's unusual.

05:21.513 --> 05:22.581
Did anything turn up?

05:24.249 --> 05:25.684
Not from our team yet.

05:26.184 --> 05:29.354
I went back over
Choi Hee Su's autopsy results first,

05:29.755 --> 05:30.989
and it's definitely homicide.

05:32.224 --> 05:33.558
Anyway, give it a little more time.

05:34.793 --> 05:37.362
Even at a fire scene,

05:37.729 --> 05:39.398
something always turns up.

05:40.499 --> 05:42.667
Now I'm curious who did it.

05:42.667 --> 05:45.604
Cases like this are rare
unless the killer is a real veteran.

05:47.105 --> 05:48.940
Could an ordinary person do it,

05:49.641 --> 05:51.410
if they were smart and meticulous?

05:52.844 --> 05:53.779
It's hard to say.

05:55.113 --> 05:55.947
Then again,

05:55.947 --> 05:57.482
when I get curious these days,

05:57.482 --> 05:59.518
I learn things through social media.

06:00.018 --> 06:01.219
Sometimes that's better.

06:05.057 --> 06:07.559
I heard they found
a woman's footprint at the scene.

06:07.926 --> 06:08.927
A woman's footprint?

06:11.630 --> 06:13.298
What's unusual is that it was barefoot.

06:13.665 --> 06:16.334
Judging by the shape and size,
it's definitely a woman's,

06:16.735 --> 06:18.336
and they said
there was blood mixed in too.

06:18.670 --> 06:19.571
Did you know?

06:20.272 --> 06:21.139
No.

06:21.573 --> 06:24.476
But how could a footprint
from back then be found only now?

06:25.510 --> 06:26.745
That doesn't make sense.

06:26.745 --> 06:29.748
Some idiot must've missed evidence
they collected at the time.

06:30.382 --> 06:32.484
That's what happens
when people do their jobs like that.

06:32.484 --> 06:35.087
No wonder they all had to write reports
and got warnings too.

06:35.721 --> 06:38.323
How do you miss evidence
that was properly submitted?

06:39.291 --> 06:40.225
Wait.

06:40.625 --> 06:42.861
The person in charge here said
there was a reason.

06:43.628 --> 06:45.063
Detective Kang, was it?

06:45.063 --> 06:47.733
That guy came here alone to the NFS...

06:47.733 --> 06:49.735
and submitted only that piece
of evidence separately.

06:49.735 --> 06:51.436
Do you know Detective Kang?

06:51.436 --> 06:52.504
I do.

06:52.504 --> 06:54.506
He came here himself? Alone?

06:54.506 --> 06:56.108
He did.

06:56.108 --> 06:58.009
He asked the person in charge here...

06:58.009 --> 07:00.312
if he knew anyone at their station.

07:00.312 --> 07:02.114
When they said no,

07:02.114 --> 07:04.049
Detective Kang said,
"Then that's fine," and handed it over.

07:05.851 --> 07:06.685
Anyway,

07:07.552 --> 07:09.454
since you're here,
go talk to the person in charge.

07:10.122 --> 07:11.356
Yes, thank you.

07:11.857 --> 07:12.791
All right.

07:16.528 --> 07:17.662
Detective Kang did that?

07:18.096 --> 07:20.265
That punk just pulled off another one.

07:20.932 --> 07:22.267
So you confirmed it too, right?

07:22.267 --> 07:23.068
Yes.

07:23.068 --> 07:25.437
I begged them to fax
only that part just now,

07:25.437 --> 07:26.338
so compare it.

07:26.338 --> 07:27.672
Okay. Good work.

07:38.216 --> 07:39.151
Let's see.

07:39.584 --> 07:40.619
(Personal Information)

07:41.787 --> 07:44.356
Height, 166.7cm.

07:44.356 --> 07:46.558
Okay, 165 cm.

07:46.558 --> 07:48.160
Foot size, 240 mm.

07:48.794 --> 07:49.995
Two hundred forty.

07:52.197 --> 07:53.165
Bingo.

07:54.633 --> 07:55.834
Thank you, Detective Kang.

07:56.702 --> 07:57.869
That guy.

08:10.949 --> 08:13.518
(Call, Myo Jin 17 calls)

08:19.591 --> 08:21.960
So the villa accident was a murder...

08:21.960 --> 08:23.829
disguised as a fire.

08:23.829 --> 08:26.598
Based on the wound location
and depth pattern,

08:27.366 --> 08:29.568
it was most likely a grudge killing.

08:36.441 --> 08:37.476
I told you clearly...

08:37.476 --> 08:39.511
that Ham Myo Jin is back to normal.

08:40.011 --> 08:42.347
But isn't it terrifying
that she's pretending she isn't?

08:42.347 --> 08:44.282
In her current condition,

08:44.916 --> 08:46.818
her memory could come back at any time.

08:48.019 --> 08:50.122
(Myo Jin)

08:50.322 --> 08:51.156
Myo Jin.

09:01.666 --> 09:03.268
Why haven't you been answering?

09:03.802 --> 09:04.803
Where are you right now?

09:05.203 --> 09:06.238
I have something to say.

09:07.572 --> 09:08.407
Okay.

09:08.774 --> 09:11.877
I'll be there soon,

09:11.877 --> 09:12.911
so we'll talk when I get there.

09:13.412 --> 09:15.213
You're at home, right?

09:15.213 --> 09:16.048
No.

09:17.883 --> 09:18.850
Then where are you?

09:20.152 --> 09:21.586
Somewhere you know too.

10:12.838 --> 10:14.373
You still don't know me?

10:15.540 --> 10:16.942
Do you really think...

10:17.642 --> 10:19.244
I'd ask you a favor for free?

10:19.678 --> 10:22.681
Why are you back here
making a fuss and annoying me?

10:23.081 --> 10:25.550
Listen properly first,

10:25.550 --> 10:27.719
then get angry or annoyed.

10:28.587 --> 10:30.122
Honestly, I call it a favor,

10:30.589 --> 10:32.290
but is this really something
I'm doing only for myself?

10:33.558 --> 10:35.360
Then are you okay...

10:35.360 --> 10:37.095
with what those two are doing?

10:37.429 --> 10:40.265
You eat expensive food
and really have nothing better to do?

10:41.600 --> 10:44.069
Unlike you, I don't care
about other people's business.

10:44.069 --> 10:45.303
Other people?

10:45.904 --> 10:48.240
Right. Sure, they're other people.

10:48.940 --> 10:50.842
Other people who ruined someone's life...

10:50.842 --> 10:52.711
and then lived happily
like nothing happened.

10:53.045 --> 10:54.079
Damn it.

10:54.613 --> 10:56.314
Honestly, the money you got back then...

10:56.982 --> 10:58.917
wouldn't even cover
that family's dog food.

10:59.518 --> 11:01.319
After all those years in prison,

11:01.987 --> 11:03.855
what kind of payment is this?

11:03.855 --> 11:05.323
It makes me mad just thinking about it.

11:06.124 --> 11:08.627
That dog-food money bought me this place.

11:09.494 --> 11:11.329
If it's heaven to me, that's enough.

11:11.329 --> 11:13.799
Anyone listening would think
you're some enlightened monk.

11:17.069 --> 11:19.271
Cut the crap and talk straight.

11:20.505 --> 11:21.673
Why on earth...

11:22.174 --> 11:24.342
are you so desperate to destroy that girl?

11:28.313 --> 11:29.281
Fine.

11:33.885 --> 11:35.487
Today, we put all our cards on the table,

11:36.154 --> 11:37.556
and after that, no more arguments.

11:37.789 --> 11:38.623
Okay?

11:40.559 --> 11:41.960
First, we grab Ham Myo Jin,

11:41.960 --> 11:43.895
that cocky little bitch, by the throat,

11:44.629 --> 11:46.965
and use her to shake down
that thief Ryu Jun Ho.

11:47.566 --> 11:48.600
I saw that bastard Ryu Jun Ho...

11:49.868 --> 11:51.970
nurse Ham Myo Jin,

11:52.170 --> 11:54.606
and he was absolutely crazy about her.

11:54.940 --> 11:56.441
Of course.

11:56.975 --> 12:00.312
So in the end, you want to squeeze
money out of Mono Group?

12:01.313 --> 12:02.547
Exactly.

12:02.547 --> 12:04.316
Now you're finally getting it.

12:04.316 --> 12:06.718
Do you think...

12:06.718 --> 12:07.819
he will dance to your threats...

12:08.286 --> 12:09.821
over a girl...

12:10.589 --> 12:13.592
when he's the next head of
a conglomerate worth hundreds of billions?

12:13.592 --> 12:15.260
This is why you're so frustrating.

12:15.994 --> 12:18.030
You really don't know anything.

12:19.564 --> 12:20.732
After Chairman Choi and his daughter...

12:21.500 --> 12:23.869
burned to death overnight,

12:24.636 --> 12:27.372
Ham Myo Jin and Ryu Jun Ho are together.
Why do you think that is?

12:29.341 --> 12:30.175
Look at you.

12:30.942 --> 12:32.310
You still haven't figured it out, right?

12:34.613 --> 12:36.415
What really happened...

12:37.182 --> 12:38.683
with the crime
you took the fall for back then.

12:39.718 --> 12:40.786
What are you talking about?

12:41.019 --> 12:42.621
It wasn't Chairman Choi.

12:43.822 --> 12:45.590
It was those two who did it.

12:46.191 --> 12:47.359
Those two?

13:05.277 --> 13:06.545
Fine, I'll explain everything.

13:06.545 --> 13:08.280
No, I don't need it.

13:10.248 --> 13:12.317
What you're thinking right now
and what you're going to say.

13:12.317 --> 13:13.985
I already know it all.

13:14.619 --> 13:15.487
Myo Jin.

13:15.787 --> 13:18.824
Can't we just look ahead?

13:20.992 --> 13:22.994
Let's just remember the fact...

13:23.729 --> 13:25.163
that we love each other.

13:25.697 --> 13:26.565
Okay?

13:27.833 --> 13:29.234
You said to me...

13:29.835 --> 13:32.137
that no matter what happens,
you'd stay by my side.

13:33.438 --> 13:34.439
If only the two of us were left...

13:34.439 --> 13:36.775
Think again about why I said that.

13:38.577 --> 13:40.245
The reason won't be what you think.

13:41.113 --> 13:43.014
It may be too hard to handle.

13:43.014 --> 13:43.849
No.

13:46.318 --> 13:47.152
I know.

13:47.586 --> 13:50.088
I know what you were
waiting for by my side.

13:50.655 --> 13:52.224
(Approached Choi Hee Su's fiancé,
Name Ryu Jun Ho)

13:52.224 --> 13:53.959
(Chairman Choi Young Ho supports
Ryu Jun Ho's business.)

13:53.959 --> 13:55.694
(Using Choi Hee Su and Ryu Jun Ho
to find out Chairman Choi's whereabouts)

13:55.694 --> 13:56.995
(Neither of them has noticed.)

14:00.198 --> 14:02.000
I looked into Chairman Choi Young Ho.

14:02.300 --> 14:03.268
That's a relief.

14:05.103 --> 14:05.971
Me...

14:06.605 --> 14:07.472
and Hee Su.

14:08.507 --> 14:09.674
We were just means to an end.

14:11.410 --> 14:13.678
Tools for you
to get to Chairman Choi Young Ho.

14:14.279 --> 14:16.982
Myo Jin must be really curious
about my dad.

14:17.883 --> 14:19.518
She talks about him every day.

14:22.220 --> 14:24.022
That has nothing to do...

14:24.790 --> 14:25.924
with the fact that we love each other.

14:27.025 --> 14:27.926
Impressive.

14:29.761 --> 14:31.329
The way you can say that so shamelessly,

14:31.329 --> 14:33.699
as if you did nothing wrong.

14:36.134 --> 14:37.002
No!

14:38.837 --> 14:41.506
I know what I did wrong.

14:41.506 --> 14:43.075
I won't run from it.

14:43.341 --> 14:44.576
I'll pay any price...

14:44.576 --> 14:46.311
until you're fully satisfied,

14:46.311 --> 14:47.412
as much as it takes.

14:53.018 --> 14:56.221
(Seoul Namyeong Police Station)

15:00.759 --> 15:01.626
Sir.

15:02.360 --> 15:03.829
The warrant for Ham Myo Jin
has been issued.

15:03.829 --> 15:05.097
Didn't you hear?

15:07.165 --> 15:08.400
Aren't you happy?

15:09.334 --> 15:11.036
We have solid evidence and a warrant.

15:11.269 --> 15:13.171
Let's say we arrest Ham Myo Jin.

15:13.672 --> 15:15.006
But what happens to Ryu Jun Ho?

15:16.208 --> 15:18.043
We still don't have
solid physical evidence.

15:18.610 --> 15:20.312
Yeah, that's the problem.

15:22.781 --> 15:23.849
That is...

15:25.350 --> 15:26.218
Detective Kang.

15:26.785 --> 15:27.686
Don't tell me...

15:28.453 --> 15:31.056
The hard drive
with the villa CCTV recordings...

15:31.723 --> 15:33.358
didn't burn up and disappear,

15:34.092 --> 15:35.460
but was removed beforehand.

15:36.995 --> 15:38.363
Removed? By whom?

15:38.363 --> 15:41.199
Of those four fancy people, two are dead,

15:42.034 --> 15:43.502
and only two are left, aren't they?

15:45.537 --> 15:46.371
Let's go.

15:46.738 --> 15:48.306
Where? Right now?

15:49.007 --> 15:51.343
He's watching us
like he can see the palm of his hand.

15:52.110 --> 15:53.712
If he thinks Ham Myo Jin is in danger,

15:54.546 --> 15:55.514
do you think he'll sit still?

15:56.048 --> 15:57.315
We don't have time. Come on!

15:57.783 --> 15:58.850
Sir.

16:01.753 --> 16:02.587
Fine.

16:04.990 --> 16:07.125
Before I met you,

16:08.060 --> 16:10.062
I'd never lived as myself.

16:11.897 --> 16:15.600
All that wealth and honor
the world envies...

16:17.035 --> 16:18.570
were given to me by those two people.

16:20.238 --> 16:22.107
But there was a condition.

16:25.310 --> 16:26.278
Obedience.

16:26.845 --> 16:27.846
You little punk.

16:28.547 --> 16:29.448
Dad.

16:34.786 --> 16:38.423
You should think things through
before you do anything.

16:38.924 --> 16:41.693
Do you want me to tell you
what's going on right now?

16:42.994 --> 16:43.895
I'm sorry.

16:48.734 --> 16:50.802
Your flight leaves at dawn tomorrow.

16:51.470 --> 16:53.638
Stay completely quiet...

16:54.072 --> 16:55.407
until I send someone.

17:04.316 --> 17:05.283
Good job.

17:07.853 --> 17:10.756
From now on too,
you're the one who protects Hee Su.

17:11.723 --> 17:13.992
But know your place.

17:14.860 --> 17:17.462
If you don't, I'll teach you.

17:31.576 --> 17:33.545
I wanted to get away.

17:33.545 --> 17:34.479
I really did.

17:37.516 --> 17:40.118
Even if I had to give back
everything I'd received,

17:40.385 --> 17:42.754
I wanted to run away from those two.

17:45.657 --> 17:46.758
Would that have been possible?

17:51.396 --> 17:52.230
Would it?

17:53.198 --> 17:54.800
You knew too.

17:54.800 --> 17:56.902
You knew, and still accepted me.

17:58.670 --> 17:59.504
That's right.

18:00.138 --> 18:02.307
Maybe, regardless of my revenge,

18:03.775 --> 18:06.678
I could have shared
the future you wanted...

18:08.980 --> 18:11.083
only if my memories hadn't returned,

18:11.717 --> 18:14.386
and I'd never learned the truth
until the end.

18:14.386 --> 18:15.187
Myo Jin.

18:15.187 --> 18:16.088
In this world,

18:16.088 --> 18:18.990
no matter how hard you try,
there are things you can never forget.

18:20.959 --> 18:22.461
Like my parents,

18:24.396 --> 18:25.797
whom you killed that day.

18:26.798 --> 18:28.533
No matter what I say,

18:29.668 --> 18:30.802
I know I can't undo that...

18:32.237 --> 18:34.573
or be forgiven.

18:35.140 --> 18:36.742
I'll spend my whole life atoning.

18:36.742 --> 18:38.143
Please give me a chance.

18:40.879 --> 18:41.747
Please.

18:43.181 --> 18:44.750
Don't look back.

18:44.750 --> 18:46.051
Let's just move forward.

18:47.886 --> 18:48.754
Give up.

18:50.655 --> 18:52.391
I'm no longer...

18:52.391 --> 18:54.559
the deranged patient you think I am.

18:57.295 --> 18:59.264
Do you really have to do this?

19:01.967 --> 19:03.035
Even if it means giving up...

19:06.104 --> 19:07.939
our entire future?

19:10.709 --> 19:12.544
I can't listen to this anymore.

19:12.911 --> 19:13.812
It's disgusting.

19:13.812 --> 19:15.380
Please, Myo Jin.

19:15.781 --> 19:16.615
Please.

19:18.850 --> 19:21.586
If this moment passes us by like this,

19:22.821 --> 19:24.756
you and I both...

19:29.795 --> 19:30.996
will regret it.

19:31.363 --> 19:33.198
You're going to pay.

19:34.566 --> 19:36.101
Because that recording
you heard earlier...

19:37.803 --> 19:39.971
will soon be heard by other people too.

20:02.694 --> 20:03.895
So this...

20:06.698 --> 20:07.999
was your idea of payback?

20:10.769 --> 20:11.837
Where is Ham Myo Jin?

20:11.837 --> 20:13.038
On the second floor.

20:15.240 --> 20:16.641
What is this?

20:20.312 --> 20:21.246
Wait.

20:21.646 --> 20:22.514
Ham Myo Jin.

20:23.982 --> 20:25.684
This is her room.

20:29.020 --> 20:29.988
What happened?

20:30.422 --> 20:32.023
She was definitely here.

20:32.858 --> 20:33.892
Hold on.

20:34.393 --> 20:35.193
Damn it.

20:57.482 --> 20:58.550
Atibam?

20:59.885 --> 21:01.953
Ryu Jun Ho isn't answering either.

21:01.953 --> 21:04.356
When they're together,
they usually don't pick up,

21:04.356 --> 21:06.024
so I think they're probably together.

21:07.859 --> 21:09.061
First, we grab Ham Myo Jin,

21:09.828 --> 21:11.797
that cocky little bitch, by the throat,

21:12.631 --> 21:14.966
and use her to shake down
that thief Ryu Jun Ho.

21:15.534 --> 21:16.535
I saw that bastard Ryu Jun Ho...

21:17.836 --> 21:20.172
nurse Ham Myo Jin,

21:20.172 --> 21:22.808
and he was absolutely crazy about her.

21:22.808 --> 21:24.209
Of course.

21:24.943 --> 21:28.413
So in the end, you want to squeeze
money out of Mono Group?

21:51.770 --> 21:53.505
This place has a nice atmosphere.

21:54.373 --> 21:56.308
You really do have good instincts.

21:58.744 --> 22:01.012
I don't care because
it's a neighborhood nobody notices,

22:02.047 --> 22:03.048
but will you be all right?

22:04.916 --> 22:05.817
What are you talking about?

22:06.218 --> 22:08.987
Are you saying you plan to kill today?

22:09.521 --> 22:11.590
No, that's not it.

22:11.990 --> 22:14.793
I'm saying they'll be able to trace
Ham Myo Jin coming all the way here later.

22:15.093 --> 22:16.228
What do we do about that?

22:16.595 --> 22:18.330
Look at the cat worrying about the mouse.

22:30.142 --> 22:32.878
But does Ham Myo Jin know this place?

22:33.879 --> 22:35.080
A place this empty and out of the way?

22:35.881 --> 22:38.550
Somehow, right after I got out of prison,

22:39.584 --> 22:42.087
she came here with a knife
in less than a week.

22:42.721 --> 22:43.822
Look here.

22:45.190 --> 22:46.425
She gave me this medal.

22:47.325 --> 22:48.660
Damn.

22:48.960 --> 22:51.329
I'm telling you,
that girl is vicious as hell.

22:52.097 --> 22:53.398
Just wait until the job's done.

22:53.799 --> 22:55.767
I'll bury her nice and neat
in a sunny spot.

22:57.736 --> 22:58.503
What?

23:04.242 --> 23:05.377
Is that Ham Myo Jin's car?

23:05.777 --> 23:06.812
Yeah, that's right.

23:07.612 --> 23:09.614
- Or not?
- Who else would come but her?

23:11.116 --> 23:12.984
She arrived right on time.

23:12.984 --> 23:14.252
Okay.

23:16.755 --> 23:17.923
When you go there,

23:18.757 --> 23:20.892
the two bastards
I mentioned will be there.

23:22.194 --> 23:24.663
I said I'd go after finishing work
at the construction site,

23:25.330 --> 23:26.465
so even if a truck shows up,

23:26.932 --> 23:28.367
they won't avoid it.

23:28.367 --> 23:30.135
You want me to ram them with my car?

23:30.669 --> 23:31.503
Yes.

23:32.771 --> 23:34.473
They're quick to catch on,

23:35.273 --> 23:36.775
so don't let your guard down.

23:37.676 --> 23:38.944
End it in one strike.

23:39.611 --> 23:40.479
Boss.

23:40.879 --> 23:42.547
I'm a marksman.

23:43.148 --> 23:44.282
You know me.

23:44.983 --> 23:45.984
How many guys
have vanished without a trace...

23:45.984 --> 23:48.754
after I set my sights on them?

23:49.788 --> 23:51.957
There's one more.

23:55.360 --> 23:58.130
When the job's done,
come straight to the shop.

23:58.130 --> 23:58.964
Got it?

24:02.267 --> 24:03.368
- Sir.
- Yeah?

24:03.735 --> 24:05.337
I'll stay around the back for now,

24:05.837 --> 24:08.306
so you just get Ham Myo Jin
to step out of the car.

24:08.306 --> 24:09.174
Got it?

24:12.177 --> 24:13.745
Just stay here. It's fine.

24:14.212 --> 24:16.114
She thinks she's meeting you alone.

24:18.316 --> 24:20.419
I told her I'd be with a guest.

24:20.952 --> 24:21.753
What?

24:22.387 --> 24:25.057
Come to think of it,
we really do have quite a bond.

24:26.391 --> 24:28.326
What are you suddenly talking about?

24:28.326 --> 24:30.095
I've lived my whole life like a dog,

24:30.662 --> 24:32.798
and now I even have a friend
to go to the afterlife with.

24:33.532 --> 24:35.967
What a luxury this is,
right at the end of a dead-end life.

24:42.941 --> 24:43.842
Damn it.

24:44.910 --> 24:46.378
- Let go of me.
- Come here.

24:46.378 --> 24:47.446
What are you doing? Are you crazy?

24:52.384 --> 24:53.251
Let me go.

24:54.386 --> 24:57.189
She's a kid whose life was ruined...

24:57.189 --> 24:58.990
because she was stupid enough
to be fooled by you.

24:58.990 --> 24:59.925
And yet,

25:00.892 --> 25:03.462
you want me to hand her over again
to a worm like you again?

25:04.363 --> 25:06.064
Why are you two fighting?

25:06.064 --> 25:07.999
You damn lowlifes.

25:17.109 --> 25:19.911
If you want to die,
die alone, you son of a bitch.

25:20.112 --> 25:21.680
For trash like us,

25:22.314 --> 25:23.482
this is only right.

25:39.064 --> 25:40.766
Damn it.

25:41.433 --> 25:42.901
Are we too late here too?

25:42.901 --> 25:45.070
What on earth is going on?

25:45.537 --> 25:46.371
Sir.

25:46.872 --> 25:48.407
Both their phones are turned off.

25:48.907 --> 25:50.208
They're definitely together.

25:51.576 --> 25:52.711
Damn it!

26:02.554 --> 26:03.722
Choi Hee Su.

26:10.829 --> 26:12.831
(Kutmin)

26:14.099 --> 26:14.966
Sir.

26:15.934 --> 26:17.235
Isn't this an anesthetic?

26:20.939 --> 26:22.908
(Kutmin)

26:22.908 --> 26:23.842
It is.

26:24.543 --> 26:26.344
A kutumin-based drug...

26:27.345 --> 26:28.613
used for general anesthesia.

26:30.048 --> 26:32.818
Atibam and Kutmin.

26:33.618 --> 26:35.687
Ham Myo Jin and Ryu Jun Ho are together,

26:35.687 --> 26:36.855
so why would they need
something like that?

27:41.053 --> 27:42.487
I always thought...

27:48.460 --> 27:51.830
that the fact you'd lost
all your memories meant,

27:53.065 --> 27:53.899
in the end,

27:55.600 --> 27:57.703
that you and I...

27:59.705 --> 28:01.873
were destined to be the only ones left.

28:03.475 --> 28:05.043
That's not...

28:06.344 --> 28:07.446
destiny.

28:10.415 --> 28:12.851
It's delusion.

28:20.092 --> 28:21.226
Is that so?

28:23.128 --> 28:24.629
When we first met,

28:30.068 --> 28:31.036
I felt...

28:32.404 --> 28:34.639
that you shared the same feelings...

28:37.109 --> 28:37.909
as I did.

28:37.909 --> 28:38.744
Of course,

28:40.812 --> 28:43.215
it was probably all part of your plan.

28:44.950 --> 28:46.785
That's when I made my mistake.

28:48.754 --> 28:49.654
That day,

28:52.557 --> 28:54.793
if I hadn't said those words...

28:56.928 --> 29:00.866
(The day before the accident)

29:15.247 --> 29:16.281
Jun Ho.

29:22.254 --> 29:23.088
Yeah?

29:24.990 --> 29:26.358
You should sleep some more.

29:26.758 --> 29:28.326
Do you have to go to the airport already?

29:31.997 --> 29:33.665
I'm about to head out.

29:41.707 --> 29:42.674
I'm scared.

29:44.543 --> 29:46.344
I'm scared you'll disappear...

29:46.344 --> 29:47.679
while I'm in Germany.

29:49.614 --> 29:51.516
You said it was a conference
you couldn't miss.

29:53.085 --> 29:55.187
Can you make me one promise?

29:56.588 --> 29:57.422
What?

29:57.856 --> 29:59.524
That no matter what happens,

30:01.193 --> 30:02.627
you won't leave me.

30:08.667 --> 30:10.602
You're thinking
about those two people again.

30:12.738 --> 30:15.907
To you, they're like family.

30:15.907 --> 30:16.742
And to me...

30:16.742 --> 30:17.976
Just tell me that.

30:19.010 --> 30:20.979
That no matter what happens,

30:23.048 --> 30:24.483
you won't leave me.

30:29.688 --> 30:31.757
Whenever I ask you something like this,

30:32.724 --> 30:34.025
you're always the same.

30:35.026 --> 30:37.796
I still haven't heard the answer I want.

30:38.263 --> 30:39.998
I'm right here beside you.

30:41.133 --> 30:42.367
I'm not going anywhere.

30:42.567 --> 30:43.602
I still...

30:46.138 --> 30:47.406
haven't heard you say...

30:47.973 --> 30:49.708
you love me even once.

30:50.509 --> 30:51.476
If...

30:53.879 --> 30:57.516
only the two of us were left...

31:04.990 --> 31:06.058
That will happen.

31:06.892 --> 31:07.793
I'm sure of it.

31:09.995 --> 31:10.862
Hee Su.

31:13.065 --> 31:14.366
Tomorrow is her birthday.

31:16.735 --> 31:19.905
When it's just the two of us,
I want us to talk about us.

31:20.806 --> 31:21.606
But...

31:21.606 --> 31:23.942
Chairman Choi returned
to Korea last night.

31:24.676 --> 31:26.278
The two of them will be together now.

31:27.379 --> 31:28.413
Don't worry.

31:29.881 --> 31:30.882
I see.

32:04.483 --> 32:06.251
- Enjoy your meal.
- Thank you.

32:10.055 --> 32:10.889
Myo Jin.

32:11.990 --> 32:12.758
Sorry.

32:21.199 --> 32:23.168
Chairman Choi Young Ho is back in Korea.

32:24.102 --> 32:24.936
Are you sure?

32:26.004 --> 32:27.739
Tomorrow is Hee Su's birthday,

32:27.739 --> 32:29.107
and he couldn't be with her last year,

32:29.107 --> 32:30.876
so he said he would
definitely come this year.

32:31.410 --> 32:33.111
Ryu Jun Ho said the same thing.

32:33.345 --> 32:34.513
It should be right.

32:34.513 --> 32:35.714
The chance has come.

32:35.714 --> 32:37.549
Ryu Jun Ho went to Germany this morning...

32:37.549 --> 32:38.950
for the conference.

32:39.785 --> 32:42.054
At the Jebu-do villa right now,
there should only be...

32:42.054 --> 32:43.255
Choi Young Ho and Choi Hee Su.

32:43.722 --> 32:45.190
This is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.

32:46.425 --> 32:47.759
How can I help?

32:53.765 --> 32:54.599
No.

32:55.400 --> 32:57.102
From here on, I'll handle it myself.

32:57.335 --> 32:58.737
Don't rush.

32:59.404 --> 33:00.839
They're not easy people.

33:02.507 --> 33:03.809
I'm ready.

33:04.810 --> 33:05.877
If I can kill...

33:06.878 --> 33:09.414
Choi Young Ho with my own hands,

33:10.282 --> 33:11.950
I don't care what happens to me.

33:12.718 --> 33:15.053
Don't rush. Take it slow.

33:16.288 --> 33:17.956
You said that to me once.

33:17.956 --> 33:18.924
Don't forget it.

33:32.237 --> 33:33.138
Hello?

33:33.438 --> 33:34.339
It's me.

33:35.674 --> 33:36.742
Jun Ho?

33:36.742 --> 33:37.576
Yeah.

33:38.610 --> 33:40.011
Have you already arrived?

33:40.278 --> 33:42.848
No. Chief Kim went to Germany in my place.

33:44.783 --> 33:47.052
How can someone else
attend the conference for you?

33:47.619 --> 33:49.121
I explained it well, so it's fine.

33:50.288 --> 33:52.491
I came to Japan for something urgent.

33:55.293 --> 33:57.396
I'll take care of some work and meet you,
even if it's late tonight.

33:57.763 --> 34:00.198
Around what time today?

34:00.832 --> 34:01.800
Late.

34:03.368 --> 34:04.936
I'll call you back on this number.

34:17.949 --> 34:20.852
The phone you have called is turned off.
After the beep...

34:31.997 --> 34:35.834
(The day of the accident)

35:43.935 --> 35:46.738
(LPG)

37:13.492 --> 37:14.659
Look who's here.

37:15.560 --> 37:16.495
Ham Myo Jin.

37:17.429 --> 37:19.064
You came all the way here?

37:20.365 --> 37:21.333
It's been a while.

37:37.949 --> 37:40.085
I know you didn't come
because you missed me.

37:41.119 --> 37:41.987
So why?

37:42.320 --> 37:44.056
Did you suddenly have something to ask?

37:49.094 --> 37:51.797
Or did you come to laugh at me?

37:52.097 --> 37:53.699
Sorry, but neither.

37:54.966 --> 37:56.768
I have nothing left to say to you.

37:56.768 --> 37:57.536
Really?

37:58.704 --> 37:59.905
I see.

38:04.543 --> 38:06.211
Are you trying to beat me to it?

38:06.945 --> 38:09.715
Do you think I still don't know
about you and Ryu Jun Ho?

38:10.348 --> 38:11.717
Think whatever you want.

38:13.351 --> 38:15.420
I'm not interested
in the two of you anymore.

38:16.855 --> 38:18.724
When did you grow up so much?

38:19.658 --> 38:20.892
My little Myo Jin.

38:24.496 --> 38:25.697
I'm not good at this kind of thing.

38:25.697 --> 38:27.399
Come on, pose for me.

38:27.966 --> 38:29.735
You saw what I did.

38:31.536 --> 38:32.637
They do stuff like this.

38:34.740 --> 38:36.108
Should I say...

38:36.742 --> 38:37.943
what you want to say first?

38:39.478 --> 38:41.747
If you like him that much, just take him.

38:43.081 --> 38:44.282
I'm sick of him now.

38:47.119 --> 38:48.687
I did think about...

38:49.688 --> 38:52.124
what I should do with the two of you.

38:54.726 --> 38:56.395
Should I let you two go...

38:57.195 --> 38:59.131
or keep you two tied down?

39:02.000 --> 39:03.902
I'm the one who always decides.

39:04.836 --> 39:06.505
You should know that much by now.

39:10.876 --> 39:11.843
Come on.

39:11.843 --> 39:13.612
Make a heart.

39:14.679 --> 39:16.081
Okay, act handsome.

39:16.081 --> 39:17.082
Act cool.

39:19.651 --> 39:21.019
You're so funny.

39:21.019 --> 39:22.587
Ryu Jun Ho, you're handsome.

39:25.457 --> 39:27.059
Do you know what my wish is?

39:27.059 --> 39:29.061
Come on, I want to take a picture.

39:29.061 --> 39:30.562
To go back to that day...

39:30.562 --> 39:31.329
Look here.

39:31.329 --> 39:33.198
and start everything over again,

39:33.965 --> 39:35.167
from the very beginning.

39:37.869 --> 39:38.937
Ryu Jun Ho...

39:41.440 --> 39:43.508
will never escape me
for the rest of his life.

39:46.578 --> 39:48.213
Without my permission,

39:48.513 --> 39:49.715
the two of you can't do anything.

39:52.718 --> 39:53.618
Do you know...

39:55.320 --> 39:57.089
what happened that day?

39:57.923 --> 39:59.524
The weather is so nice.

39:59.524 --> 40:00.525
Beautiful.

40:02.027 --> 40:03.528
Smile.

40:03.528 --> 40:04.529
I said smile.

40:06.732 --> 40:07.666
What?

40:08.300 --> 40:09.568
Why are you making that face?

40:10.202 --> 40:12.337
Anyone would think
you had some terminal illness.

40:18.510 --> 40:20.245
Even after seeing this,
does it still not feel real?

40:21.113 --> 40:23.448
We're really going to America now.

40:23.448 --> 40:25.050
You to Brown, me to RISD.

40:25.317 --> 40:26.251
Aren't you happy?

40:30.622 --> 40:32.357
Are you seriously
going to keep acting like this?

40:32.624 --> 40:34.126
Why are you so serious?

40:35.694 --> 40:38.130
I feel like I'm going abroad to study
by begging for it.

40:39.197 --> 40:40.999
Going this far to make it happen
just feels wrong.

40:40.999 --> 40:41.867
You fool.

40:42.701 --> 40:44.970
I told you I already talked to my dad.

40:44.970 --> 40:46.038
So what?

40:46.038 --> 40:48.106
Tuition and living expenses
are too much money.

40:48.573 --> 40:50.976
It'll keep costing this much for years.

40:50.976 --> 40:52.811
How can I owe him all of it?

40:52.811 --> 40:54.079
Get a part-time job there.

40:55.180 --> 40:57.282
Study hard and get a scholarship too.

40:57.716 --> 40:59.317
That's all. What are you worried about?

41:00.252 --> 41:02.220
I already did the math.

41:02.921 --> 41:05.290
It'll only be enough for me
to buy the books I want to read.

41:09.327 --> 41:10.162
You fool.

41:11.196 --> 41:12.397
Are you really going to do that?

41:13.131 --> 41:15.333
Do you think I'd just let you
struggle like that?

41:18.503 --> 41:19.971
Dad said so.

41:20.605 --> 41:22.074
You can pay him back later
once you succeed.

41:22.541 --> 41:23.909
Then it's fine.

41:23.909 --> 41:25.343
Even so...

41:25.343 --> 41:26.478
Be quiet.

41:27.679 --> 41:28.880
That means you should treat me well.

41:30.348 --> 41:31.216
Otherwise...

41:32.617 --> 41:33.618
Otherwise?

41:34.052 --> 41:36.121
You can go be an idiot and join the army.

41:40.058 --> 41:41.526
You'd better be good to me.

41:50.502 --> 41:51.370
Hey.

41:51.370 --> 41:52.804
Pull over, now.

41:53.171 --> 41:55.440
We drank. You're drunk right now.

41:55.741 --> 41:56.608
I don't want to.

41:56.875 --> 41:58.310
There's no one around.
What's the big deal?

41:58.510 --> 41:59.811
It's dangerous. Pull over.

41:59.811 --> 42:00.779
Stop the car!

42:01.146 --> 42:03.115
Why are you always so serious?

42:03.482 --> 42:05.250
You won't let me do anything fun.

42:05.250 --> 42:06.818
I'm not listening to you anymore.

42:09.488 --> 42:10.555
Stop acting crazy.

42:10.555 --> 42:11.790
Stop right now!

42:12.057 --> 42:12.958
No.

42:13.225 --> 42:15.260
Who would be out here
in this backwater place?

42:15.260 --> 42:16.128
Let go.

42:16.862 --> 42:17.863
It's my choice.

42:19.798 --> 42:21.033
Please, stop it.

42:24.069 --> 42:25.504
The cherry blossoms are so beautiful.

42:28.940 --> 42:29.908
No!

42:42.187 --> 42:44.022
What if she finds out it died?

42:45.290 --> 42:46.658
Myo Jin...

42:47.559 --> 42:49.561
will cry her eyes out.

42:50.195 --> 42:52.431
I'm so upset.

42:55.500 --> 42:58.103
What are you going to do
about the crack in your arm?

42:58.303 --> 43:00.439
Forget it. It's nothing.

43:00.672 --> 43:02.874
What do you mean, nothing?

43:02.874 --> 43:04.242
I was really shocked.

43:05.043 --> 43:07.979
In this day and age,
how can young people still drive drunk?

43:09.481 --> 43:10.415
So?

43:11.550 --> 43:12.784
What did those kids say?

43:14.953 --> 43:16.855
They brought up money first.

43:16.855 --> 43:18.623
They said they'd pay whatever I asked,

43:18.623 --> 43:20.392
as long as I didn't report them.

43:22.594 --> 43:26.631
Young kids like that, with that mindset...

43:28.467 --> 43:30.068
Then what about our dog?

43:31.103 --> 43:33.538
What did they say about killing our dog?

43:34.840 --> 43:36.742
If they don't even care
that a person got hurt,

43:36.742 --> 43:38.877
do you think they care about a mere dog?

43:39.711 --> 43:41.413
What nasty little brats.

43:42.147 --> 43:43.682
Before they cause an even bigger accident,

43:43.682 --> 43:45.550
shouldn't someone teach them a lesson?

43:45.550 --> 43:46.418
Yes.

43:46.985 --> 43:49.287
I told them
I was reporting them to the police,

43:49.287 --> 43:51.356
so they'd better be ready.

43:51.690 --> 43:54.059
I said they should go to jail
and learn their lesson.

43:54.593 --> 43:56.795
I took photos of everything on my phone.

44:07.205 --> 44:10.142
They say drunk-driving laws
are really strict these days.

44:11.576 --> 44:13.011
Isn't that a bit too far?

44:14.446 --> 44:17.249
Ruining young kids' futures is too...

44:20.852 --> 44:22.554
I know.

44:22.554 --> 44:23.889
I won't call the police.

44:24.222 --> 44:25.924
I didn't even report them.

44:27.492 --> 44:29.895
But those kids...

45:13.071 --> 45:13.972
Hee Su.

45:14.239 --> 45:15.540
It's all because of you.

45:15.540 --> 45:16.641
Get out of my sight.

45:16.641 --> 45:18.510
Disappear from my sight.

45:18.510 --> 45:19.611
You and I...

45:19.945 --> 45:21.413
were driving drunk without licenses.

45:21.747 --> 45:23.615
Forget studying in America. It's all over.

45:24.082 --> 45:25.951
My life is over!

45:31.490 --> 45:32.824
Dad is going to kill me.

45:33.325 --> 45:34.359
Hey.

45:34.359 --> 45:35.727
What are you going to tell my dad?

45:38.864 --> 45:40.832
What am I supposed to do
if you just do nothing like that?

45:41.199 --> 45:42.868
Are you not thinking at all right now?

45:42.868 --> 45:44.202
Are you insane?

45:44.436 --> 45:46.438
What about your promise to my dad?

45:46.938 --> 45:49.908
You did this to me,
and you have nothing to say?

45:50.375 --> 45:51.676
I'll figure something out.

45:52.511 --> 45:53.345
Shut up.

45:55.280 --> 45:56.681
He filmed everything...

45:57.182 --> 45:58.683
and took the liquor bottles
with our fingerprints on them...

45:58.683 --> 45:59.951
to hand over to the police.

46:00.352 --> 46:01.820
I refused to go to the police station,

46:01.820 --> 46:03.422
so we only barely avoided
being dragged there.

46:03.422 --> 46:04.322
Hey.

46:04.322 --> 46:06.425
Why the hell did you admit that I drank?

46:07.592 --> 46:08.393
Why?

46:08.894 --> 46:10.262
After you did
every stupid thing you could,

46:10.262 --> 46:12.164
what are you going to do now?

46:32.651 --> 46:33.585
I know.

46:37.122 --> 46:39.124
This is something I should handle.

46:41.259 --> 46:43.562
I promised your father
I'd take care of you.

46:47.866 --> 46:49.000
I'll handle it myself.

46:51.870 --> 46:53.472
That's what I'm here for.

46:58.076 --> 46:59.511
If it's for you, I should do it.

47:01.813 --> 47:02.948
That's how it should be.

47:13.759 --> 47:15.627
It was such a perfect day.

47:17.863 --> 47:19.664
That day was my birthday,

47:20.065 --> 47:20.966
and the day before,

47:22.768 --> 47:24.669
the acceptance letters came from America,

47:24.970 --> 47:26.271
for both of us.

47:44.756 --> 47:45.590
Hello?

48:10.582 --> 48:11.516
What should I do?

48:13.685 --> 48:14.686
Was it...

48:16.755 --> 48:17.889
you two?

48:20.659 --> 48:21.493
What?

48:22.661 --> 48:24.196
Did Ryu Jun Ho tell you?

48:25.430 --> 48:26.298
Tell me.

48:27.999 --> 48:29.000
Was it you two?

48:29.000 --> 48:30.435
Did he tell you that?

48:32.704 --> 48:34.306
That crazy bastard.

48:36.341 --> 48:37.909
The one who set the fire was Ryu Jun Ho.

48:38.543 --> 48:40.579
Ryu Jun Ho killed those people.

48:44.116 --> 48:45.016
Why?

48:46.284 --> 48:47.219
For what reason?

48:47.219 --> 48:48.587
Are you really asking me that?

48:48.587 --> 48:50.021
Imagine if this got out.

48:50.021 --> 48:51.656
People would all blame me.

48:52.424 --> 48:54.493
They wouldn't even know
what really happened,

48:54.493 --> 48:56.661
but they'd all go crazy
trying to tear me apart.

49:00.265 --> 49:02.267
It wasn't something
that had to get that big.

49:05.037 --> 49:06.538
Yes, we caused the accident,

49:07.072 --> 49:08.640
but we admitted our mistake...

49:09.007 --> 49:12.144
and said we'd compensate him fully,
as much as he wanted.

49:12.144 --> 49:14.546
But he kept threatening
to put us in prison.

49:15.514 --> 49:16.581
Is that...

49:19.017 --> 49:20.886
the reason...

49:22.854 --> 49:23.789
you killed people?

49:26.324 --> 49:28.226
They weren't people...

49:30.562 --> 49:31.963
who deserved...

49:32.998 --> 49:33.832
to die like that.

49:50.515 --> 49:51.516
I told you.

49:53.585 --> 49:54.720
From that moment on,

49:57.255 --> 49:59.091
I had a reason it had to be that way.

50:00.726 --> 50:02.027
Now you understand too, don't you?

50:03.395 --> 50:04.363
How I felt.

50:05.831 --> 50:07.165
Do you understand my pain?

50:07.165 --> 50:08.266
That was your reason...

50:09.868 --> 50:11.336
for killing those people?

50:11.336 --> 50:12.571
I told you.

50:12.838 --> 50:15.374
Back then, we got acceptance letters
from the best universities in America.

50:15.374 --> 50:16.274
Can that...

50:18.176 --> 50:20.379
be a reason to kill people?

50:25.317 --> 50:27.252
People with nothing to lose...

50:28.086 --> 50:30.589
all think like you, of course.

50:31.957 --> 50:32.824
What?

50:34.960 --> 50:35.727
You.

50:36.228 --> 50:38.597
When you first came to my exhibition
and saw my paintings, you cried.

50:39.431 --> 50:40.532
You said it yourself...

50:41.366 --> 50:43.201
that you could feel
my sorrow inside my paintings.

50:43.568 --> 50:44.469
My passion,

50:45.103 --> 50:47.372
my talent, all of it, so vividly.

50:47.939 --> 50:49.941
You said that you'd never felt
anything like it before.

50:51.343 --> 50:52.577
You're insane.

50:53.945 --> 50:56.248
If those people had ruined me back then,

51:02.587 --> 51:03.755
my paintings...

51:06.158 --> 51:07.759
wouldn't exist in the world now.

51:11.496 --> 51:12.998
Can you even imagine that?

51:19.838 --> 51:20.772
Hey.

51:21.006 --> 51:23.709
Do you know
what people with nothing to lose...

51:25.277 --> 51:27.045
are capable of?

51:31.717 --> 51:32.751
They only wait for their chance.

51:33.351 --> 51:35.921
They wait to find fault
with people who have money,

51:36.254 --> 51:38.190
and when they get the chance,
they pounce and rip them apart.

51:38.190 --> 51:39.057
Like animals.

51:39.991 --> 51:41.760
That's what happened to us that day.

51:42.661 --> 51:44.796
There is no one in this world
who has nothing to lose.

51:45.764 --> 51:48.400
Because those people were
someone's father and someone's mother too.

53:15.387 --> 53:16.722
Honey.

53:17.856 --> 53:19.558
Honey, what do we do?

53:19.558 --> 53:20.926
It's a fire. Wait.

53:22.461 --> 53:23.362
Honey.

53:23.362 --> 53:24.896
Wait a second.

53:30.302 --> 53:31.136
No.

53:37.275 --> 53:38.110
Mom.

53:38.643 --> 53:40.011
Mom, Dad.

53:43.248 --> 53:45.584
- Myo Jin.
- Mom.

53:45.584 --> 53:46.485
Myo Jin.

53:46.485 --> 53:47.419
Mom.

53:48.220 --> 53:49.087
Myo Jin.

53:51.857 --> 53:52.891
Honey.

53:53.558 --> 53:55.327
Mom.

53:56.595 --> 53:57.462
Mom.

53:59.664 --> 54:01.099
Mom, no.

54:01.099 --> 54:02.501
No.

54:03.769 --> 54:04.970
No, Mom.

54:04.970 --> 54:06.671
Myo Jin, get out quickly.

54:06.671 --> 54:09.107
I'll get your mom out. Go.

54:09.107 --> 54:10.242
- Go.
- Hurry, go.

54:10.242 --> 54:12.010
Go, Myo Jin.

54:12.010 --> 54:13.178
No.

54:13.178 --> 54:15.380
I can't go.

54:15.380 --> 54:17.215
Go, Myo Jin.

54:17.215 --> 54:18.683
No.

54:23.088 --> 54:24.589
What is happening?

54:26.792 --> 54:27.793
Mom, Dad.

54:27.793 --> 54:29.161
Mom, Dad, no.

54:29.161 --> 54:30.929
Mom, Dad.

54:31.396 --> 54:33.098
Why won't this work? Get up.

54:33.098 --> 54:34.132
Dad, no.

54:34.132 --> 54:35.133
No.

54:35.133 --> 54:36.702
No, Mom.

54:36.702 --> 54:37.703
Dad.

54:39.571 --> 54:40.839
Myo Jin.

54:40.839 --> 54:42.407
Myo Jin!

54:45.811 --> 54:46.778
Myo Jin.

54:47.479 --> 54:48.747
If you go in there, you'll die.

54:48.747 --> 54:50.549
- Dad.
- You'll die too.

54:50.549 --> 54:52.551
Mom, Dad.

54:54.019 --> 54:55.087
Dad.

55:01.026 --> 55:01.993
No.

55:02.227 --> 55:03.261
No.

55:03.595 --> 55:04.963
No.

55:04.963 --> 55:05.964
No!

55:42.434 --> 55:47.005
(REVERSE)

55:47.305 --> 55:49.241
Choi Hee Su and Ryu Jun Ho.

55:49.241 --> 55:50.876
I'm sure it isn't a coincidence.

55:50.876 --> 55:53.445
Because there's no such thing
as revenge that only gives back...

55:53.445 --> 55:54.780
what was done to you.

55:54.780 --> 55:56.448
Should I give that present to you?

55:56.782 --> 55:59.351
You have to remember.

55:59.951 --> 56:01.620
Over one stupid memory?

56:01.620 --> 56:03.855
It's already over and gone.

56:03.855 --> 56:06.158
You went all the way to the villa
to save Choi Hee Su...

56:06.458 --> 56:08.026
and almost lost your life.

56:08.360 --> 56:11.096
But my feelings remembered you,

56:11.396 --> 56:13.331
and they showed me what I had to do.

56:14.199 --> 56:16.201
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
